# Fixed defect 2613, 2026-11-20, lane umbrella-2: `heroes add` never writes a
# private module into a `packages` line, which names what a program's `use`
# writes and no program's module names a private one. `heroes add
# kit/text/internal/scan` wrote it and placed the part; it is refused at
# exit 1 with the module it belongs to named, before any entry is asked, and
# the catalogue stays as it was.
use <kit>/csv

function main()
    print(csv.first("one,two"))
